{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 7000}, "text": " Hi, it's time for Strandbeast Build yet again, and we're here with Sagan."}, {"offsets": {"from": 7000, "to": 9000}, "text": " Alright, show us what we just built, Sagan."}, {"offsets": {"from": 9000, "to": 11000}, "text": " We just built this whole thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 11000, "to": 15000}, "text": " Alright, and show us how these spin."}, {"offsets": {"from": 15000, "to": 21000}, "text": " Magic! Not really magic. Just at the bottom here, cogs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 21000, "to": 25000}, "text": " I'm turning this red handle, which turns the cogs, that turns these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 26000, "to": 30000}, "text": " And it looks a bit like soccer ball protectors in a soccer position."}, {"offsets": {"from": 30000, "to": 33000}, "text": " And this is very common in GBC, isn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 33000, "to": 40000}, "text": " We see this a lot, and the balls are going to go in here and this sort of like funnels through one by one or something, maybe?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 40000, "to": 42000}, "text": " What do you think? Sorts them out?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 42000, "to": 44000}, "text": " Oh yeah, look, because..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 44000, "to": 50000}, "text": " Yeah, so these counter-rotate. Show us again. Go the full rotation."}, {"offsets": {"from": 51000, "to": 57000}, "text": " Yeah, and these can actually lift up and down, so we're not sure how that's going to work yet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 57000, "to": 61000}, "text": " But let's see how it fits on to our existing structure, Sagan."}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 64000}, "text": " Let's have a look. So, tell us how you think it goes on here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 64000, "to": 70000}, "text": " I think it goes on by, see that bottom bit there and over there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 70000, "to": 73000}, "text": " Those click into here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 76000}, "text": " Yeah, so we're going to have to spread it apart a bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 79000}, "text": " Yep, like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 79000, "to": 88000}, "text": " And then these bits there click over into here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 93000, "to": 100000}, "text": " It's tricky. And then this, see, we've got this shaft down here which we showed last time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 100000, "to": 106000}, "text": " That actually goes up into and drives that bit there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 108000, "to": 114000}, "text": " Yep. First, just plug this bit in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 117000, "to": 118000}, "text": " Now..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 124000}, "text": " Oh, and it's slightly tilted too. The ramp has tilted. That makes sense."}, {"offsets": {"from": 124000, "to": 126000}, "text": " Then we plug this in here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 131000, "to": 133000}, "text": " There's near."}, {"offsets": {"from": 137000, "to": 139000}, "text": " You got it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 141000, "to": 143000}, "text": " Maybe a bit tricky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 148000}, "text": " Got it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 148000, "to": 150000}, "text": " Got it? Awesome."}, {"offsets": {"from": 150000, "to": 152000}, "text": " Now let's see how it runs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 153000}, "text": " You want to plug it in?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 153000, "to": 155000}, "text": " To our motor here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 158000}, "text": " Plug it into our battery pack. And we haven't tried this yet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 159000, "to": 160000}, "text": " Hope it works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 160000, "to": 162000}, "text": " Hope the battery's still on power."}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 166000}, "text": " Wait."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 168000}, "text": " Okay, switch it on, say again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 173000}, "text": " Oh, they're slowly turning. Go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 177000, "to": 181000}, "text": " Oh, no, no. Something down there broke."}, {"offsets": {"from": 181000, "to": 184000}, "text": " But you saw it. These will eventually turn, yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 184000, "to": 187000}, "text": " We'll just fix this bit here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 187000, "to": 188000}, "text": " Can we fix it now?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 189000}, "text": " Yeah, easy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 189000, "to": 190000}, "text": " Easy peasy?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 190000, "to": 191000}, "text": " There."}, {"offsets": {"from": 192000, "to": 193000}, "text": " Right there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 193000, "to": 195000}, "text": " Try it again. There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 197000, "to": 199000}, "text": " They're not moving."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 205000}, "text": " No, something's wrong there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 205000, "to": 207000}, "text": " Wait, there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 211000, "to": 213000}, "text": " Something's wrong."}, {"offsets": {"from": 213000, "to": 214000}, "text": " Ah, well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 215000, "to": 217000}, "text": " All right, turn it on, say again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 217000, "to": 218000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 220000, "to": 221000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 221000, "to": 223000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 224000, "to": 225000}, "text": " Whoa, it's all..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225000, "to": 227000}, "text": " It's because it's all not fully..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 227000, "to": 228000}, "text": " Ah, you saw it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 228000, "to": 231000}, "text": " It's all not fully, like, tied together yet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 231000, "to": 234000}, "text": " So, like, it's not all braced together."}, {"offsets": {"from": 234000, "to": 236000}, "text": " So it's a bit all loosey-goosey."}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 240000}, "text": " But, yeah, you can see how that was going to work."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240000, "to": 242000}, "text": " And then we've got another shaft over here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 242000, "to": 244000}, "text": " which is going to turn something else,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 244000, "to": 246000}, "text": " which are these big strand-based things."}, {"offsets": {"from": 247000, "to": 248000}, "text": " Yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 248000, "to": 249000}, "text": " Ah, dammit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 249000, "to": 250000}, "text": " And..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 250000, "to": 253000}, "text": " It's this piece here that's causing all our problems."}, {"offsets": {"from": 256000, "to": 257000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 258000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 258000, "to": 260000}, "text": " That's the way that it works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 260000, "to": 262000}, "text": " And... but it'll come apart really easily."}, {"offsets": {"from": 262000, "to": 263000}, "text": " So... but there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 263000, "to": 264000}, "text": " Hope you get the idea."}, {"offsets": {"from": 264000, "to": 268000}, "text": " So, anyway, you can see that that's all supposed to spin."}, {"offsets": {"from": 268000, "to": 270000}, "text": " And this is all genius. It really is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 270000, "to": 272000}, "text": " And this all comes from the parts from..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 272000, "to": 274000}, "text": " This is PV Productions."}, {"offsets": {"from": 274000, "to": 276000}, "text": " Is this a Josh Darvid?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 276000, "to": 278000}, "text": " I think it's a Josh Darvid design."}, {"offsets": {"from": 278000, "to": 279000}, "text": " Yeah, I think so."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 280000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 280000, "to": 281000}, "text": " Anyway, that's very cool."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 282000}, "text": " Josh Darvid, something like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 282000, "to": 283000}, "text": " So we're on our way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 283000, "to": 287000}, "text": " This is one major piece of our strand base."}, {"offsets": {"from": 287000, "to": 290000}, "text": " We're up to page 42."}, {"offsets": {"from": 290000, "to": 292000}, "text": " Fantastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 292000, "to": 296000}, "text": " Page 42 out of 100-something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 296000, "to": 297000}, "text": " 100-something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 297000, "to": 298000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 298000, "to": 299000}, "text": " That's pretty cool, isn't it, Sagan?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 299000, "to": 300000}, "text": " We're on our way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 300000, "to": 302000}, "text": " What do we say?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 302000, "to": 304000}, "text": " Uh..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 304000, "to": 305000}, "text": " Catch you next time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 305000, "to": 307000}, "text": " Catch you next time."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}